.TH CCOL_END 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
ccol_end \- end sentinel for iteration
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/citerators.h>   /* or any container header */

ccol_end
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
ccol_end expands to NULL. Every container iterator is NULL once it has
gone past the end of its sequence, so that is the value to compare
against.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR ccol_begin (3),
.BR ccol_iter_next (3)
